00:27:19.094 --> 00:27:22.723
in like a stud and kills
the remaining demons elsewhere, and the kids

00:27:22.723 --> 00:27:26.768
reach the tunnel location and head underground,
slipping in through the back of the plant

00:27:26.768 --> 00:27:31.023
and taking out this demon as glasses
guy hacks the security cameras, blinding

00:27:31.023 --> 00:27:32.858
Peter Ratri and his demon army.

00:27:32.858 --> 00:27:35.360
The smallest of the kids
dress up in the same uniform

00:27:35.360 --> 00:27:38.989
as the orphan kids getting shipped out and slip
in while the mothers leave the room,

00:27:39.031 --> 00:27:43.952
helping all the little orphans escape before
locking the mothers inside the entrance walls.

00:27:44.036 --> 00:27:45.329
Everybody finally reaches

00:27:45.329 --> 00:27:50.208
the majestic Portal Hall entrance way, right
as they get surrounded by an army of mothers.

00:27:50.250 --> 00:27:53.670
Looks like Peter Ratri
and Mother were onto them from the start,

00:27:53.670 --> 00:27:58.300
but nothing is, as it seems, as the mother
pulls a double whammy backstabbing Peter Ratri

00:27:58.300 --> 00:28:00.844
revealing to him
that all the mothers kill switches inside

00:28:00.844 --> 00:28:05.015
their bodies were neutralized
when Glass's guy hacked the entire system earlier.

00:28:05.015 --> 00:28:09.269
If Peter Ratri went through the trouble
of implanting all the mothers to ensure they don't

00:28:09.269 --> 00:28:11.354
double cross him,
then maybe he should have thought

00:28:11.354 --> 00:28:14.441
about implementing a second failsafe
switch on the off chance.

00:28:14.441 --> 00:28:19.237
The main one didn't work because relying on one
method alone can hold all of these mothers hostage

00:28:19.237 --> 00:28:22.991
is the dumbest thing that he could have done,
and it's not very super villainy of him.

00:28:23.033 --> 00:28:27.662
In fact, this was about as evil as those bad guys
in films who always spend about ten minutes

00:28:27.662 --> 00:28:31.208
telling the good guy
their entire evil plan, only to have them escape.

00:28:31.208 --> 00:28:35.128
Eventually, if Peter Ratri wanted to ensure
that no one would ever betray him,

00:28:35.128 --> 00:28:37.923
then he should have been diabolical
with his insurance strategy.

00:28:37.964 --> 00:28:38.757
Hear me out now.

00:28:38.757 --> 00:28:41.259
If I was an evil super villain
running from a human meat

00:28:41.259 --> 00:28:45.055
farming business, I would have had the mothers
impregnated from the start of their career

00:28:45.096 --> 00:28:47.015
through IVF fertility treatments.

00:28:47.015 --> 00:28:48.433
And then after I would have taken

00:28:48.433 --> 00:28:52.771
their newborn babies from them to be raised
in a separate non-meat farm facility for life.

00:28:52.771 --> 00:28:56.274
This way on the off chance that one
or all of the mothers managed to escape

00:28:56.274 --> 00:29:00.487
or disarm their implanted kill switches,
then we simply could have used their very own

00:29:00.487 --> 00:29:01.988
children as hostages.

00:29:01.988 --> 00:29:03.865
I know, I know, 2020 hindsight.

00:29:03.865 --> 00:29:08.662
So sad, but this would have been a cool
alternative and also sounds super diabolical.

00:29:08.703 --> 00:29:09.496
I like it.

00:29:09.496 --> 00:29:10.121
Peter Rabbit

00:29:10.121 --> 00:29:14.042
released cornered with his back against the wall,
but has one less trick up his sleeve

00:29:14.042 --> 00:29:17.879
because he reveals that a backup of Demon Army
is coming to kill everyone in this room.

00:29:17.879 --> 00:29:21.883
But in an absolutely insane twist of events,
it turns out that these demons

00:29:21.883 --> 00:29:26.346
are not here to kill the kids, but Peter Ratri
and the demons running the meat farm.

00:29:26.346 --> 00:29:30.392
And we find out that Sonju and the old demon
used their blood to cure all the demons

00:29:30.392 --> 00:29:33.895
from the nearby town,
freeing them from their dependance on human meat,

00:29:33.937 --> 00:29:37.107
meaning they don't have to feed on humans anymore
to survive.

00:29:37.148 --> 00:29:42.028
But Peter Raftery doesn't give two shits about
any of this sweet news and condemns Emma and Rae

00:29:42.028 --> 00:29:46.575
claiming that humans will simply destroy and mess
everything up that they've worked so hard for.

00:29:46.616 --> 00:29:46.825
Right?

00:29:46.825 --> 00:29:51.121
As he exits stage left by slitting his own throat,
Emma then forgives mother

00:29:51.121 --> 00:29:53.290
for everything that she did and invites them

00:29:53.290 --> 00:29:57.961
and all the others to join them in the human world
and all of which she gracefully accepts.

00:29:57.961 --> 00:29:59.421
But right before they enter the.

00:29:59.421 --> 00:30:03.466
Emma Ray Norman and his teammates
and some of the demons tell the little kids

00:30:03.466 --> 00:30:05.176
and mother that they'll stay behind

00:30:05.176 --> 00:30:08.972
to rescue all the kids within the demon world
and that eventually they'll meet again

00:30:08.972 --> 00:30:13.351
as the grand entrance portal door closes
behind on Emma as her and her crew set out

00:30:13.351 --> 00:30:15.729
to save the rest of the kids
within the demon world

00:30:15.729 --> 00:30:20.150
and go to change the course of history
for the first time in 1000 years.

00:30:20.191 --> 00:30:23.695
And if you don't want to get canceled
after season two to forget Eliza Skype, comment

